{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The deliberate door for bringing a model under management (spectrum S1). Validates the directory matches the declared backend, records provenance (source, fingerprint over names+sizes, footprint from metadata) into the runtime library's models record, and renders runtime/agent/model/registry.json for the service. Local paths only for now; hf: sources and hub fetch land later on this branch. Nothing acquires weights on its own - this command is the only door.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;","params":[{"desc":"Registry name for the model - lowercase [a-z0-9-_], the handle MODEL= and recipes use.","name":"name","type":"String"},{"desc":"Where the weights are: a local directory path (the hub form hf:org/repo@revision lands later on this branch).","name":"source","type":"String"},{"desc":"nanochat (a nanochat base dir: tokenizer/ + checkpoint dirs) or hf (a directory with config.json). hf serves after S3; the record stages now.","name":"backend","type":"String"},{"desc":"The forgetting-guard anchor: mint (self-sample at the door - records mint_pending until the service endpoint lands), none, or a dataset name.","name":"anchor","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"zszomo1a017741685j1","readers":[],"time":1787100271771,"username":"system","writers":[]}